{"id": "0x0337", "plain_text": "Hole of \"Z\"\nLet's go through this small\nhole!\n--- PAGE ---\nStand in front of the hole and\npush [D-Pad] towards it. When the \nAction Icon shows \"Enter,\" press\n[A] to crawl into the hole.\n--- PAGE ---\nPay attention to what the Action\nIcon says!", "category": "SIGN", "control_codes": ["QUICKTEXT_ENABLE", "COLOR", "COLOR(UNKNOWN_69)", "NEWLINE", "COLOR(UNKNOWN_64)", "QUICKTEXT_DISABLE", "BOX_BREAK", "COLOR(UNKNOWN_68)", "COLOR(UNKNOWN_67)", "END"], "variables": [], "button_glyphs": ["D-Pad", "A"], "choices": []}
