{"id": "0x0340", "plain_text": "View Point with [C-Left] Targeting\nWhen you have no object to look\nat, you can just look forward\nwith [C-Left].\n--- PAGE ---\nStop moving and then change the\ndirection you are facing, or hold\ndown [C-Left] for a little while.\n--- PAGE ---\nThis can help you get oriented in\nthe direction you want to face.\nIt's quite convenient!\n--- PAGE ---\nIf you hold down [C-Left], you can\nwalk sideways while facing \nstraight ahead.\n--- PAGE ---\nWalking sideways can be a very\nimportant technique in dungeon\ncorridors. Turn around and try\ndoing this right now.", "category": "SIGN", "control_codes": ["QUICKTEXT_ENABLE", "COLOR", "COLOR(UNKNOWN_69)", "NEWLINE", "COLOR(UNKNOWN_64)", "COLOR(UNKNOWN_68)", "QUICKTEXT_DISABLE", "BOX_BREAK", "COLOR(UNKNOWN_65)", "END"], "variables": [], "button_glyphs": ["C-Left"], "choices": []}
{"id": "0x0341", "plain_text": "Stepping Stones in the Pond\nIf you boldly go in the direction\nyou want to jump, you will leap\nautomatically.\n--- PAGE ---\nIf you hop around on the stones,\nyou'll become happier!", "category": "SIGN", "control_codes": ["QUICKTEXT_ENABLE", "COLOR", "COLOR(UNKNOWN_65)", "NEWLINE", "COLOR(UNKNOWN_64)", "QUICKTEXT_DISABLE", "BOX_BREAK", "END"], "variables": [], "button_glyphs": [], "choices": []}
{"id": "0x0342", "plain_text": "No Diving Allowed\n--It won't do you any good!", "category": "SIGN", "control_codes": ["QUICKTEXT_ENABLE", "SHIFT", "COLOR", "COLOR(UNKNOWN_65)", "NEWLINE", "COLOR(UNKNOWN_64)", "QUICKTEXT_DISABLE", "END"], "variables": [], "button_glyphs": [], "choices": []}
{"id": "0x0343", "plain_text": "Switch Targeting\nIf you see a [Control Stick] icon above an \nobject, you can target it with [C-Left].\n--- PAGE ---\nIn other words, if you press [C-Left] \nwhen you see [Control Stick] above an object,\nyou can lock on to it.\n--- PAGE ---\nIf you press [C-Left] again, the lock\nwill either release or it will\ntransfer to the next object with\nthe [Control Stick] above it.\n--- PAGE ---\nWhen you have many enemies in\nyour field of view and you want\nto escape, press [C-Left] while holding\nback on [D-Pad] to cancel targeting.\n--- PAGE ---\nYou can target the stones next to\nthis sign for practice!", "category": "SIGN", "control_codes": ["QUICKTEXT_ENABLE", "COLOR", "COLOR(UNKNOWN_69)", "NEWLINE", "COLOR(UNKNOWN_64)", "COLOR(UNKNOWN_66)", "COLOR(UNKNOWN_68)", "QUICKTEXT_DISABLE", "BOX_BREAK", "COLOR(UNKNOWN_70)", "COLOR(UNKNOWN_65)", "END"], "variables": [], "button_glyphs": ["Control Stick", "C-Left", "D-Pad"], "choices": []}
{"id": "0x0344", "plain_text": "Forest Stage\n--- PAGE ---\nWe are waiting to see your\nbeautiful face!\nWin fabulous prizes!", "category": "SIGN", "control_codes": ["QUICKTEXT_ENABLE", "SHIFT", "COLOR", "COLOR(UNKNOWN_66)", "COLOR(UNKNOWN_64)", "QUICKTEXT_DISABLE", "BOX_BREAK", "NEWLINE", "END"], "variables": [], "button_glyphs": [], "choices": []}
{"id": "0x0345", "plain_text": "Visit the\nHouse of the Know-it-All Brothers\nto get answers to all your\nitem-related questions!", "category": "SIGN", "control_codes": ["QUICKTEXT_ENABLE", "SHIFT", "NEWLINE", "COLOR", "COLOR(UNKNOWN_65)", "COLOR(UNKNOWN_64)", "QUICKTEXT_DISABLE", "END"], "variables": [], "button_glyphs": [], "choices": []}
