{"id": "0x0401", "plain_text": "They say that you can swim faster\nby continuously pressing [B].", "category": "NPC_DIALOGUE", "control_codes": ["NEWLINE", "COLOR", "COLOR(UNKNOWN_66)", "COLOR(UNKNOWN_64)", "END"], "variables": [], "button_glyphs": ["B"], "choices": []}
{"id": "0x0402", "plain_text": "They say that there is a secret \nnear the lone tree which is not\nfar from the river in the \nnorthwest part of Hyrule Field.", "category": "NPC_DIALOGUE", "control_codes": ["NEWLINE", "END"], "variables": [], "button_glyphs": [], "choices": []}
{"id": "0x0403", "plain_text": "They say that there is a secret\non the road that leads to Lake\nHylia.", "category": "NPC_DIALOGUE", "control_codes": ["NEWLINE", "END"], "variables": [], "button_glyphs": [], "choices": []}
{"id": "0x0404", "plain_text": "They say that Biggoron's Sword is \nsuper sharp and will never break.", "category": "NPC_DIALOGUE", "control_codes": ["NEWLINE", "END"], "variables": [], "button_glyphs": [], "choices": []}
{"id": "0x0405", "plain_text": "They say that Medigoron didn't \nreally think about his own size, \nso his store is really cramped.", "category": "NPC_DIALOGUE", "control_codes": ["NEWLINE", "END"], "variables": [], "button_glyphs": [], "choices": []}
{"id": "0x0406", "plain_text": "They say that Malon set the\noriginal record in the obstacle\ncourse of Lon Lon Ranch.", "category": "NPC_DIALOGUE", "control_codes": ["NEWLINE", "END"], "variables": [], "button_glyphs": [], "choices": []}
{"id": "0x0407", "plain_text": "They say that Malon of Lon Lon \nRanch hopes a knight in shining \narmor will come and sweep her off \nher feet someday.", "category": "NPC_DIALOGUE", "control_codes": ["NEWLINE", "END"], "variables": [], "button_glyphs": [], "choices": []}
{"id": "0x0408", "plain_text": "They say that Ruto, the Zora \nPrincess who is known for her \nselfish nature, likes a certain \nboy...", "category": "NPC_DIALOGUE", "control_codes": ["NEWLINE", "END"], "variables": [], "button_glyphs": [], "choices": []}
{"id": "0x0409", "plain_text": "They say that players who select\nthe \"HOLD\" option for \"Z \nTARGETING\" are the real \"Zelda\nplayers!\"", "category": "NPC_DIALOGUE", "control_codes": ["NEWLINE", "END"], "variables": [], "button_glyphs": [], "choices": []}
{"id": "0x040A", "plain_text": "They say that there is a secret\nnear a tree in Kakariko Village.", "category": "NPC_DIALOGUE", "control_codes": ["NEWLINE", "END"], "variables": [], "button_glyphs": [], "choices": []}
{"id": "0x040B", "plain_text": "They say that, contrary to her \nelegant image, Princess Zelda of \nHyrule Castle is, in fact, a \ntomboy!", "category": "NPC_DIALOGUE", "control_codes": ["NEWLINE", "END"], "variables": [], "button_glyphs": [], "choices": []}
{"id": "0x040C", "plain_text": "They say that Princess Zelda's \nnanny is actually one of the \nSheikah, who many thought had \ndied out.", "category": "NPC_DIALOGUE", "control_codes": ["NEWLINE", "END"], "variables": [], "button_glyphs": [], "choices": []}
{"id": "0x040D", "plain_text": "They say that there is a man who\ncan always be found running\naround in Hyrule Field.", "category": "NPC_DIALOGUE", "control_codes": ["NEWLINE", "END"], "variables": [], "button_glyphs": [], "choices": []}
{"id": "0x040E", "plain_text": "They say that it is against the\nrules to use glasses at the \nTreasure Chest Shop in Hyrule\nCastle Town Market.", "category": "NPC_DIALOGUE", "control_codes": ["NEWLINE", "END"], "variables": [], "button_glyphs": [], "choices": []}
{"id": "0x040F", "plain_text": "They say that the Chicken Lady \ngoes to the Lakeside Laboratory \nto study how to breed pocket-\nsized Cuccos.", "category": "NPC_DIALOGUE", "control_codes": ["NEWLINE", "END"], "variables": [], "button_glyphs": [], "choices": []}
{"id": "0x0410", "plain_text": "They say that Gerudos sometimes\ncome to Hyrule Castle Town to\nlook for boyfriends.", "category": "NPC_DIALOGUE", "control_codes": ["NEWLINE", "END"], "variables": [], "button_glyphs": [], "choices": []}
{"id": "0x0411", "plain_text": "They say that the thief named \nNabooru, who haunts this area, is\na Gerudo.", "category": "NPC_DIALOGUE", "control_codes": ["NEWLINE", "END"], "variables": [], "button_glyphs": [], "choices": []}
{"id": "0x0412", "plain_text": "They say that if you get close to a\nbutterfly while holding a Deku\nStick in your hands, something\ngood will happen.", "category": "NPC_DIALOGUE", "control_codes": ["NEWLINE", "END"], "variables": [], "button_glyphs": [], "choices": []}
{"id": "0x0413", "plain_text": "They say that you may find\nsomething new in dungeons that\nyou have already finished.", "category": "NPC_DIALOGUE", "control_codes": ["NEWLINE", "END"], "variables": [], "button_glyphs": [], "choices": []}
{"id": "0x0414", "plain_text": "They say that Gerudos worship \nGanondorf almost like a god.", "category": "NPC_DIALOGUE", "control_codes": ["NEWLINE", "END"], "variables": [], "button_glyphs": [], "choices": []}
{"id": "0x0415", "plain_text": "They say that there is a secret \naround the entrance to Gerudo \nValley.", "category": "NPC_DIALOGUE", "control_codes": ["NEWLINE", "END"], "variables": [], "button_glyphs": [], "choices": []}
{"id": "0x0416", "plain_text": "They say that the owl named\nKaepora Gaebora is the\nreincarnation of an ancient Sage.", "category": "NPC_DIALOGUE", "control_codes": ["NEWLINE", "END"], "variables": [], "button_glyphs": [], "choices": []}
{"id": "0x0417", "plain_text": "They say that strange owl,\nKaepora Gaebora, may look big and\nheavy, but its character is rather \nlighthearted.", "category": "NPC_DIALOGUE", "control_codes": ["NEWLINE", "END"], "variables": [], "button_glyphs": [], "choices": []}
{"id": "0x0418", "plain_text": "They say that the horse\nGanondorf rides is a solid black\nGerudo stallion.", "category": "NPC_DIALOGUE", "control_codes": ["NEWLINE", "END"], "variables": [], "button_glyphs": [], "choices": []}
{"id": "0x0419", "plain_text": "They say that Ganondorf is not \nsatisfied with ruling only the\nGerudo and aims to conquer all\nof Hyrule!", "category": "NPC_DIALOGUE", "control_codes": ["NEWLINE", "END"], "variables": [], "button_glyphs": [], "choices": []}
{"id": "0x041A", "plain_text": "They say that the treasure you\ncan earn in the Gerudo's Training\nGround is not as great as you\nwould expect, given its difficulty!", "category": "NPC_DIALOGUE", "control_codes": ["NEWLINE", "END"], "variables": [], "button_glyphs": [], "choices": []}
{"id": "0x041B", "plain_text": "They say that there is a switch \nthat you can activate only by\nusing the Spin Attack.", "category": "NPC_DIALOGUE", "control_codes": ["NEWLINE", "END"], "variables": [], "button_glyphs": [], "choices": []}
{"id": "0x041C", "plain_text": "They say that it's possible to find\na total of 100 Gold Skulltulas\nthroughout Hyrule.", "category": "NPC_DIALOGUE", "control_codes": ["NEWLINE", "END"], "variables": [], "button_glyphs": [], "choices": []}
{"id": "0x041D", "plain_text": "They say that when non-fairy\nfolk enter the Lost Woods, they\nbecome monsters!", "category": "NPC_DIALOGUE", "control_codes": ["NEWLINE", "END"], "variables": [], "button_glyphs": [], "choices": []}
{"id": "0x041E", "plain_text": "They say that the small holes in\nthe ground that you can find all\nover Hyrule make perfect breeding\nground for bugs.", "category": "NPC_DIALOGUE", "control_codes": ["NEWLINE", "END"], "variables": [], "button_glyphs": [], "choices": []}
{"id": "0x041F", "plain_text": "They say that the Kokiri are \nalways followed by small fairies.", "category": "NPC_DIALOGUE", "control_codes": ["NEWLINE", "END"], "variables": [], "button_glyphs": [], "choices": []}
